WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Open Research to review investigations. Use New investigation to start a question.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Write an objective, a falsifiable hypothesis and a competing explanation.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Choose conditions deliberately. Reserve independent seeds before running.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Start the investigation. Follow events and evidence; pause or resume when needed.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Freeze the selected condition, then evaluate its reserved confirmation batch.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Read uncertainty and provenance, then export the investigation and reports.
